# QR Forge runs entirely in the browser. It has no backend, no API calls, and
# no secrets — this file exists so that any future configuration has an
# obvious home. Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to client code,
# so never put a secret in here.

# Base path when deploying under a sub-directory (e.g. /qr-forge/).
# VITE_BASE_PATH=
